 "traps": [
  "the npm package has no name, so its unit is referred to by the root; composer.json is the unit bookstackapp/bookstack in the same folder",
  "the services are documented in .env.example.complete, not in .env.example, which lists only the database and mail settings",
  "docker-compose.yml is for development: it starts MySQL and MailHog; the node service is the project's own build container",
  "the ten OAuth providers come from laravel/socialite and socialiteproviders/* packages, each enabled by its *_APP_ID variable",
  "Gravatar and diagrams.net are default URLs in code, both turned off by DISABLE_EXTERNAL_SERVICES",
  "the JavaScript is built by esbuild from dev/build/esbuild.mjs and the styles by Sass: there is no Vite or webpack; Jest is the only JavaScript test framework",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
